      "header": "Momentary-Chronic Regulatory Focus Scale (MPRF) Report",
      "footer_refs": [
        "Fay, D., Urbach, T., & Scheithauer, M. (2019). The Momentary-Chronic Regulatory Focus scale. Measurement Instruments for the Social Sciences, 1, e10993. https://doi.org/10.5964/miss.10993",
        "Higgins, E. T. (1997). Beyond pleasure and pain. American Psychologist, 52, 1280–1300.",
        "Higher scores per subscale = stronger orientation toward that regulatory focus. Id/G = promotion; Ou/N-L = prevention."
      ]
